#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:108
#: b9382a8149ba49edbfc29f850d20134f
msgid "`Random Slab` vs `Vacancy Defect Generation`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:110
#: 06a0469a5c57456183111cac4a131ecc
msgid "`Random Slab` 改的是边界条件和表面取向，结果会引入真空层与自由表面。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Slab` changes surface orientation and cell geometry, introducing "
"vacuum and free surfaces."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:111
#: a23bcb5441574db28e72c443d073670f
msgid "`Vacancy Defect Generation` 改的是体相或表面内部的删位强度，不会自动生成表面。"
msgstr ""
"`Vacancy Defect Generation` removes sites from an existing bulk or surface "
"structure; it does not create a surface by itself."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:112
#: bfd0047e5d0c4118bcefef725a301da0
msgid "想研究“表面缺陷”，通常先 `Random Slab`，再 `Insert Defect` 或 `Vacancy Defect Generation`。"
msgstr ""
"For surface defects, usually run `Random Slab` first, then `Insert Defect` "
"or `Vacancy Defect Generation`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:114
#: 4bfae6428415467db97778de3e9156dd
msgid "`Random Doping` vs `Composition Sweep` vs `Random Occupancy`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:116
#: 548c732d6aae40a6a1cdfb54cb340f04
msgid "`Composition Sweep` 负责定义“目标配比空间”，输出仍是带目标配比标签的结构副本。"
msgstr ""
"`Composition Sweep` defines the target-composition space. Its outputs are "
"still labeled copies, not realized site occupations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:117
#: b148308f8ec4422cb09d9cce31983f85
msgid "`Random Occupancy` 负责把目标配比真正落到离散原子位点上。"
msgstr "`Random Occupancy` realizes each target composition on discrete atomic sites."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:118
#: cd5b7192f9a2485eb969202775989fcb
msgid "`Random Doping` 更适合“给定规则后直接做一次随机替换”，而不是系统地扫完整配比空间。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Doping` is better for applying explicit random substitution rules "
"than for scanning a complete composition space."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:120
#: 2a70621d10fb48cebdc9eae7be64d6fa
msgid "`Atomic Perturb` vs `Vib Mode Perturb`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:122
#: b8f4d92883674d04909b3efbc108a291
msgid "`Atomic Perturb` 是无模型的随机位移，适合快速补近平衡噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`Atomic Perturb` adds model-free random displacements for quick near-"
"equilibrium augmentation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:123
#: 9527de1e4ca649f68dad03e3bc9575ba
msgid "`Vib Mode Perturb` 基于已有振动模态，适合更接近特定频率空间的位移采样。"
msgstr ""
"`Vib Mode Perturb` uses existing normal modes to sample selected regions of "
"vibrational-coordinate space."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:124
#: 24f7fe8763cd42af8020c130d2bc6d5d
msgid "输入里没有模态数组时，不能直接用 `Vib Mode Perturb`。"
msgstr ""
"`Vib Mode Perturb` cannot operate until the input contains recognized mode "
"arrays."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:126
#: b108e00eee2248ba83a46fd1fcb13df8
msgid "`Stacking Fault` vs `Strict GSFE Path`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:128
#: 80f0008e07ac4ea9915282186117af2c
msgid "`Stacking Fault` 更适合快速生成层错候选，参数以滑移向量和切面比例为主。"
msgstr ""
"`Stacking Fault` is a quick candidate generator controlled mainly by a "
"displacement vector and a cut fraction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:129
#: 729ff416a6334bd8a65969a9d0d1fe14
msgid "`Strict GSFE Path` 适合你已经知道目标滑移系统，需要明确写出 `plane_hkl` 和 `slip_uvw`。"
msgstr ""
"`Strict GSFE Path` is for a known slip system specified explicitly by "
"`plane_hkl` and `slip_uvw`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:130
#: bd4f1272df624916bd656056523b89e6
msgid ""
"`Strict GSFE Path` 要求输入已经是 slab-oriented cell：第三晶胞方向必须垂直于 `plane_hkl`。如果只是普通"
" cubic fcc cell，先用 `Crystal Prototype Builder` 的 `fcc111` 原型或自己构造合适 slab "
"cell。"
msgstr ""
"`Strict GSFE Path` requires a slab-oriented periodic cell whose third cell "
"vector is normal to `plane_hkl`. For a conventional cubic fcc input, first "
"use the `fcc111` prototype from `Crystal Prototype Builder` or construct an "
"equivalent oriented cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:132
#: d8094294db844caa92118929ce22311e
msgid "`Set Magnetic Moments` vs `Magnetic Order` vs `Magmom Rotation`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:134
#: 47a98ef091e04ec2993d3de278c1dbca
msgid "`Set Magnetic Moments` 只负责把磁矩写进去，适合静态初始化。"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` writes one consistent moment state and is intended "
"for static initialization."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:135
#: 7b72422df8644554bb1e69a22e40b5cc
msgid "`Magnetic Order` 会生成 FM / AFM / PM 等多磁态分支。"
msgstr "`Magnetic Order` branches into FM, AFM, and PM-like initial states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:136
#: a081b72630794983bee4d8ddeeeba5b3
msgid "`Magmom Rotation` 基于已有磁矩做角度扰动，适合补充非共线或局部旋转样本。"
msgstr ""
"`Magmom Rotation` perturbs existing directions and is suitable for local "
"noncollinear augmentation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:138
#: 8ad5274402014406b4b81e08a51caa5c
msgid "按分组浏览"
msgstr "Browse by category"

